    "text": "Case-I<br /><br />In equilibrium<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">up</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">mg</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bnuuu.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 278px;\" /><br /><br />Case-II<br /><br />Let block is pressed by x more in liquid<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">mg</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">net</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">AL</mi><msub><mrow><mi ma